    "text": "WSLS\nwebsite\nRadford\nJones, Smith named to Radford athletics 2025 HOF Class\n1 hours ago\nRADFORD, Va. – Radford University announced it’s athletics 2025 Hall of Fame Class including familiar names and faces in southwest Virginia. The five-member class includes Vincent Wyatt (men’s track and field), Yvette “Pebbles” Smith (women’s basketball), Coach Mike Jones (men’s basketball), Javonte Green (men’s basketball) and Rachel Wiechecki (volleyball).",
